/** @mainpage Qore tokenizer Module

    @tableofcontents

    @section tokenizerintro tokenizer Module Introduction

    <img src="ml-logo.svg" width="96" alt="tokenizer module logo"/>

    The \c tokenizer module provides HuggingFace-compatible text tokenization for %Qore.
    It can load any \c tokenizer.json file from
    <a href="https://huggingface.co/">HuggingFace Hub</a> and produce the same token IDs
    as the Python \c transformers library. This enables local text tokenization for ONNX
    model inference without a Python dependency.

    Supported tokenization models:
    - <b>BPE</b> (Byte-Pair Encoding) — used by GPT-2, RoBERTa, Llama, Mistral
    - <b>WordPiece</b> — used by BERT, DistilBERT, ALBERT, sentence-transformers
    - <b>Unigram</b> (SentencePiece) — used by T5, XLM-RoBERTa, mT5

    @subsection tokenizer_normalizers Supported Normalizers
    - \c BertNormalizer — clean text, handle CJK chars, strip accents, lowercase
    - \c NFC / \c NFD / \c NFKC / \c NFKD — Unicode normalization via utf8proc
    - \c Precompiled — SentencePiece Darts DoubleArray trie normalization (used by T5)
    - \c Sequence — chains multiple normalizers
    - \c Replace / \c Prepend / \c Lowercase / \c StripAccents / \c Strip
      (\c Replace supports both HuggingFace \c {"String": "..."} and
      \c {"Regex": "..."} patterns)

    @subsection tokenizer_pretokenizers Supported Pre-tokenizers
    - \c BertPreTokenizer — split on whitespace and punctuation
    - \c ByteLevel — GPT-2 byte-to-unicode mapping with regex splitting
    - \c Metaspace — SentencePiece word boundary marking with \c ▁
    - \c Whitespace / \c WhitespaceSplit / \c Sequence

    @subsection tokenizer_postprocessors Supported Post-processors
    - \c TemplateProcessing — configurable special token insertion
    - \c BertProcessing — \c [CLS] A \c [SEP] / \c [CLS] A \c [SEP] B \c [SEP]
    - \c RobertaProcessing — \c \<s\> A \c \</s\> / \c \<s\> A \c \</s\>\</s\> B \c \</s\>
    - \c ByteLevel / \c Sequence

    @subsection tokenizer_decoders Supported Decoders
    - \c WordPiece — strips \c ## prefix, cleanup
    - \c ByteLevel — reverses GPT-2 byte mapping
    - \c Metaspace — replaces \c ▁ back to spaces
    - \c ByteFallback — decodes \c \<0xHH\> byte tokens to UTF-8
    - \c Fuse / \c Strip / \c Replace / \c Sequence

    @section tokenizerqlibmodules Qore User Modules

    - @ref dataprovidermlintro "DataProviderML" — ML-based data pipeline processors wrapping the ml binary module
    - @ref qoretokenizerutilsintro "QoreTokenizerUtils" — document chunking, token counting, embeddings, and re-ranking for RAG pipelines

